Scope
-----
This notice covers everything in this repository, including the Realmforge
mod and the Realmforge QA mod (code, assets, data, dungeon rooms and
everything shipped in their jars), except:
- the Realmforge modpack in pack/, covered by pack/LICENSE;
- Better Key Binds in better-key-binds/, covered by better-key-binds/LICENSE;
- Apotheosis's data (the snapshot in tools/id_universe/ and the files generated
  from it, data/apotheosis/ and others in the jar), which stays under its MIT
  license, kept in the jar's META-INF/third_party/apotheosis/;
- the Gradle wrapper (gradlew, gradlew.bat, gradle/wrapper/), which stays under
  Gradle's Apache License 2.0.

Terms
-----
No permission is granted to copy, modify, redistribute, re-upload, mirror or
republish the mod or any part of it, in whole or in part, without prior
written permission from the copyright holder. Use in a modpack is
prohibited, except in the official Realmforge modpack.

You may download the mod through its official channels and play with it.
Hosting this repository publicly on GitHub grants only the rights described
in the GitHub Terms of Service (viewing and forking on GitHub).

Credits
-------
Some dungeon rooms started from rooms of Stonevaults (TheGrimsey),
DungeonZ (Globox_Z, Zura), Desert Dungeon (D1scoball, Globox_Z),
Dungeon Now Loading (Hexnowloading) and Mo' Structures (Frqnny).
The MIT notices of Stonevaults, DungeonZ and Desert Dungeon are kept in
content/rooms/third_party/<source>/ and in the jar's
META-INF/third_party/<source>/.
